WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.043
In tutorial 4.1, you'll pick the right
tool, check its credits and time,

00:00:11.093 --> 00:00:12.866
and start your first analysis.

00:00:13.896 --> 00:00:16.946
First, click Run an
analysis in the sidebar.

00:00:16.996 --> 00:00:20.125
Then check the website you
want to work on, at the top.

00:00:21.119 --> 00:00:23.819
Tools are grouped by
what you want to achieve.

00:00:23.869 --> 00:00:27.419
And Recommended next suggests
a good one to try first.

00:00:28.419 --> 00:00:33.214
Click a group to see its tools. Each card
says what you get, the credits it uses,

00:00:33.264 --> 00:00:34.914
and about how long it takes.

00:00:35.948 --> 00:00:39.874
Now click Start on the tool you
need. Here, it's Keyword verdict.

00:00:41.994 --> 00:00:46.409
On the right, the Summary shows the
website, what you get, the credits it uses,

00:00:46.459 --> 00:00:47.758
and the time it takes.

00:00:49.398 --> 00:00:54.323
Credits are held while it runs, and you're
only charged what it uses, never more.

00:00:54.373 --> 00:00:56.442
The bar shows what's left after it.

00:00:57.423 --> 00:01:00.773
Then fill in the form, and click
the button under the Summary.

00:01:00.823 --> 00:01:02.928
For this tool, it's Get the verdict.

00:01:05.448 --> 00:01:10.198
Your run opens on its own page, with
its progress, credits and reports.

00:01:10.248 --> 00:01:12.620
You can leave the page,
and it keeps going.

00:01:13.614 --> 00:01:17.954
So, choose the website, pick a tool by
your goal, check the credits and time,

00:01:18.004 --> 00:01:19.058
and start the run.

00:01:20.593 --> 00:01:26.808
You're ready to run analyses. Next, find
keywords worth winning, in tutorial 4.2.
